WEBVTT

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.756
pomislite, kako je danes

00:11:31.756 --> 00:11:33.651
netradicionalnim družinam:

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:36.246
družine z dvemi očeti, ali dvemi mamami,

00:11:36.246 --> 00:11:37.951
samohranilska gospodinjstva.

00:11:37.951 --> 00:11:42.344
Ti resnično improvizirajo
na vsakem koraku.

00:11:42.344 --> 00:11:46.135
Danes, v bolj razviti deželi,

00:11:46.135 --> 00:11:48.865
in oprostite mi zdaj
za poseganje po klišeju

00:11:48.865 --> 00:11:51.919
in sklicevanje na, ja, Švedsko,

00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:54.840
se starši lahko zanesejo na državo

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:57.489
za podporo.

00:11:57.489 --> 00:11:59.368
So države, ki priznavajo

00:11:59.368 --> 00:12:00.801
strahove in spreminjajoče se vloge